---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About & Contact"
  description="About CoreFlow, and how to reach us or book a free consultation."
>
  <section class="intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">About</span>
      <h1>An early-stage team building CoreFlow the right way</h1>
      <p class="dek">
        CoreFlow is early-stage — we're working directly with a small number of pilot customers
        to build something genuinely useful, not chasing feature checklists. We'd rather tell you
        that plainly than present ourselves as bigger than we are.
        <!-- TODO(owner): replace with your real company name, founding story,
             team size, and location once decided — this is placeholder honesty,
             not placeholder fiction. -->
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="consultation" class="consultation">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>Book a free consultation</h2>
        <p>
          30 minutes, no cost, no obligation. Tell us about your current sales, inventory, or
          approval workflow and we'll show you specifically what CoreFlow changes — not a generic
          product tour. See what actually happens on the call in our
          <a href="/about#audit-process">audit process</a> below.
        </p>
        <p class="fine-print">
          We only use the information below to prepare for and schedule the call. See our
          <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
        </p>
      </div>
      <form
        class="contact-form"
        name="consultation"
        method="POST"
        action="/thank-you"
        data-netlify="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
      >
        <!--
          Netlify Forms (free tier, works automatically once this site is
          deployed on Netlify — no separate form service needed). Netlify's
          build-time bot detects this form from the static HTML because of
          the data-netlify attribute + hidden form-name field below. Until
          deployed on Netlify, this form does not submit anywhere real.

          Fields below double as the qualification form from Phase 7
          (04_.../Deliverables/07_Consultation_Audit/Qualification-Criteria.md)
          — company size, current tools, and biggest pain point give whoever
          runs the call real prep instead of walking in cold.
        -->
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="consultation" />
        <p class="hidden-field">
          <label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
        </p>
        <label>
          Name
          <input type="text" name="name" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          Work email
          <input type="email" name="email" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          Company
          <input type="text" name="company" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Company size
          <select name="companySize">
            <option value="">Select…</option>
            <option value="1-10">1–10 employees</option>
            <option value="11-50">11–50 employees</option>
            <option value="51-200">51–200 employees</option>
            <option value="200+">200+ employees</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          What are you using today? (spreadsheets, another tool, nothing formal)
          <input type="text" name="currentTools" placeholder="e.g. Excel + WhatsApp for approvals" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Your biggest pain point right now
          <textarea name="painPoint" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. our inventory reconciliation process"></textarea>
        </label>
        <button type="submit">Request a Consultation</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap booking-embed">
      <h3>Prefer to pick a time directly?</h3>
      <p class="fine-print">
        <!-- TODO(owner): create a free Cal.com account, set up a 30-minute
             "Free Consultation" event type, and replace REPLACE_WITH_CAL_USERNAME
             below with the real booking link. Cal.com's free tier covers this
             use case fully — no paid plan needed. -->
        Live scheduling isn't connected yet — for now, use the form above and we'll follow up to
        find a time. Once live, you'll be able to pick a slot instantly below.
      </p>
      <div class="cal-embed-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Cal.com booking widget — pending owner setup</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="audit-process" class="audit-process">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What actually happens on the call</h2>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <div class="process-card">
          <span class="step">1</span>
          <h3>Discovery — 10 min</h3>
          <p>We ask about your actual current process in the area you flagged, not a generic product tour.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-card">
          <span class="step">2</span>
          <h3>Mapping — 15 min</h3>
          <p>We connect what you described to specific capabilities — by name — and say plainly if something isn't a strong fit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-card">
          <span class="step">3</span>
          <h3>Next steps — 5 min</h3>
          <p>A concrete next step, including a written follow-up summary within 2–3 business days — useful even if you never buy CoreFlow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-details">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Other ways to reach us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:iamwaqas31@gmail.com">iamwaqas31@gmail.com</a>
          <!-- Real, monitored inbox. Swap for hello@<domain> once a custom
               domain is registered; do not put an address here that nobody reads. -->
        </li>
        <li><strong>Location:</strong> Serving customers across Pakistan/regional and international markets <!-- TODO(owner): add a real address once one exists; don't imply an office that doesn't --></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .wrap {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .intro {
    padding: 64px 0 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-core);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 38px);
    margin-top: 10px;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .dek {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 16.5px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .consultation {
    padding: 56px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .two-col {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .consultation h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
  }
  .consultation p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 14px;
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  .fine-print {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .hidden-field {
    position: absolute;
    left: -9999px;
  }
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .contact-form label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    font: inherit;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .contact-form button {
    margin-top: 6px;
    background: var(--color-flow);
    color: var(--color-on-flow);
    border: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .contact-details {
    padding: 48px 0 72px;
  }
  .contact-details h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .contact-details ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .contact-form select {
    font: inherit;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .booking-embed {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }
  .booking-embed h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .booking-embed .fine-print {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .cal-embed-placeholder {
    margin-top: 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .audit-process {
    padding: 56px 0 72px;
  }
  .audit-process h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .process-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .process-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
  }
  .process-card .step {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-core);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .process-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .process-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
